<div class="eyebrow">Research area · 04</div><h1 class="" data-bn="প্রকৃতি ও জলবায়ু">Nature &amp; <em>Climate</em></h1><p class="lead">Floods, salinity, cyclones and river erosion: adaptation designed by the people who live with them. We start where the water is: chars, the coast and the river banks.</p>
